## Gabarit du rapport final (CLOSED)

À append en queue de `REPORT_FILE` lors du CLOSED :

```
## Final report

Task: <TASK_ID>
Plan: <PLAN_FILE>
Initial implementation: <résumé 2 lignes>

Remediation attempts: <N>
  Attempt 1: <bug_signature> → diag <root_cause> → fix <change> → PASSED
  Attempt 2: ...
  ...

Final audit: PASSED
Critical zones touched: NONE | <liste>
Human gate: NONE | <GATE_FILE path>

Cycle: CLOSED after <N> remediation round(s)
```

